{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23649","headline":"初授秘监拜赐金紫闲吟小酌偶写所怀 · 白居易","name":"初授秘监拜赐金紫闲吟小酌偶写所怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫袍新秘监，白首旧书生。\n鬓雪人间寿，腰金世上荣。\n子孙无可念，产业不能营。\n酒引眼前兴，诗留身後名。\n闲倾三数酌，醉咏十余声。\n便是羲皇代，先从心太平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23649.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23649","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}